  "detail_text": "This request for information focuses on the provision of the above-referenced Depot Activation capabilities for the F-15 EX’s current EX Rudder Sensor. The repair and maintenance of the Rudder Sensor requires not only the Rudder Sensor itself but all associated parts/spares and the rights in technical data necessary to maintain and ensure the software used in the displays functions correctly to support verification of repairs at designated ALC.",
